        "а) $0.15(x-4)=9.9-0.3(x-1)$；",
        "б) $1.6x(x-4)=4x(0.4x-7)+0.72$；",
        "в) $0.7(x-3)-(0.5-2x)=0.9(3x-1)+0.1$；",
        "г) $5.6-3(2-0.4x)=0.4(3x-1)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "143",
